Description: decentralised LAN instant messenger (deepin-MeshLink)
 deepin-MeshLink (深度织讯) is a peer-to-peer instant-messaging client for
 deepin/UOS. Every node is also a server: nodes discover each other through
 signed UDP heartbeats, form chat rooms, relay text and image messages, and
 distribute files chunk-by-chunk only when the receiver explicitly asks.
 .
 All TCP traffic runs over TLS 1.3 with self-signed certificates, TOFU
 pinning and Ed25519 channel authentication. The account identity is the
 first 32 hex characters of SHA-256 over the node public key; private key
 material is persisted with AES-256-GCM.
